@startuml
title Example Data Flow: Trade Matching Process

actor User
participant "API Gateway" as APIGW
participant "Matching Engine" as Matcher
participant "Trade DB" as TradeDB
participant "Wallet Service" as Wallet
participant "WebSocket Server" as WebSocket

== 사용자 매수 주문 요청 ==
User -> APIGW : Place Buy Order (0.5 BTC @ 1,000,000 KRW)
APIGW -> Matcher : Submit Order

== 매칭 및 체결 ==
Matcher -> Matcher : Find matching sell orders\n(price <= 1,000,000)
alt Matching Found
  Matcher -> Matcher : Execute trade\n(0.5 BTC @ matched price)
  Matcher -> TradeDB : Save Trade Record
  Matcher -> Wallet : Update User Wallet Balance
  Matcher -> WebSocket : Publish Trade Event
else No Match
  Matcher -> Matcher : Add to Order Book
end

== 사용자에게 결과 전송 ==
WebSocket -> User : Real-time trade update

@enduml
